</td></table>
<table border=0 cellpadding=1 cellspacing=0 width=100%><td nowrap>
<font size=3 color=#606060><strong>▽</strong> 2004/10/06 (水) 01:38:43 <strong>▽</strong> <a href="mailto:mk8426@infoseek.jp">ｍｋ８４２６＠自宅</a> </font></td>
